Subject: [PATCH 02/23] fix(plugins): keep element-form plugin menu icons

resolvePluginIcon takes a curated icon name or a plugin-owned component.
An icon registered as a ready-made element -- the shape the contract
allowed before that resolution existed, and the shape kandev-plugin-tags
still sends -- is neither: it is looked up in PLUGIN_ICONS as a name,
misses, and silently becomes the fallback puzzle glyph. The tags plugin's
"Add tag..." item has shown a puzzle piece rather than its tag icon since
