  and its describe in `kanban-card-menu-items.test.tsx`; it moved next to the
  tests it explains, and the keys test file gained the two pairs a
  width-based escape runs together (`U+D83C` vs `U+00D8`+`3C`, `U+0100` vs
  `U+0010`+`0`).
